  "cast_notes": "Navy gunner: striped shirt, blue knit cap, calm, squints when he fires. Second gunner: blue vest, covers his ears, then works. Navy captain: blue coat with gold, peaked cap, points, smug. Powder boy: carries a keg. The lucky sailor: red-and-white striped shirt, red knit cap, the 'you' of the film, grins when he is spared. Pirate captain: brown coat, wide hat, smug then pale. Deckhand: brown vest, fixes the rail, ducks and falls. Barrel carrier, lookout, deckhand: busy all the time.",
